# `expected.json` and `store-expected.json` were captured from
# `src/evidence/` by `tools/generate-adapter-oracle.mts` and
# `tools/generate-store-oracle.mts`, and all four were deleted at the quoin#458
# cutover per FR-101-AC-5. Nothing here can re-derive these bytes any more, so a
