# TypeScript answered. See PROVENANCE.md and STORE-PROVENANCE.md beside them for
# the revision to restore from. `cases.json` and `store-cases.json` are
# hand-authored input and ARE formatted.
rust/crates/quoin-evidence/tests/golden/expected.json
rust/crates/quoin-evidence/tests/golden/store-expected.json

